# The DLL is committed so a player does not need a cross-compiler to install it. Never diffed,
# never line-ending-normalised.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.dc6 binary
*.png binary

# The DLL reads these at runtime, and it reads them on Windows, where CRLF is ordinary — the
# parsers tolerate either (sscanf stops at whitespace). Pinned to LF anyway so a diff between two
# machines is about the content.
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
